STATEMENT step_event_ok_upd
∀mc ms s f f'.
  (step_event_ok (mc with next_interfer := f) ms s ⇔ step_event_ok mc ms s) ∧
  (step_event_ok (mc with ffi_interfer := f') ms s ⇔ step_event_ok mc ms s)
